            "sid": "1CH 26:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Awandu werefumanyeghe na kivalwa cha Ishari, Kenamia na wana wake werenekeloghe kazi rewizighana Waisraeli sa wabaa na watanyi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.26.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.26.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 26:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Awa werefumanyeghe na kivalwa cha Hebroni, Hashabia na wamzawo, wandu elfu na maghana mfungade, werekoghe wikiwizighana Waisraeli wiko magharibi ya Moda ghwa Jordani kwa kazi yose ya BWANA na kwa wudumiki ghwa mzuri. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.26.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.26.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 26:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jerija orekoghe Mhebroni nao orekoghe m'baa wa Wahebroni kuseko kutala kinyumba angu kichuku. Mwaka ghwa mirongo ina ghwa kubonya nguma kwa Daudi, malagho gha Wahebroni ghereloleloghe, na wandu wamu waro wiko mang'oni wikaandawoneka Jazeri ya Gileadi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.26.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.26.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 26:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mzuri Daudi ukammbika Jerija na waruna, wandu elfu iwi na maghana mfungade wiko na kudima wikaie wabaa wa vinyumba va Wareubeni, na Wagadi, na nusu ya kichuku cha Manase kwa kula ilagho ja maza ra Mlungu, na maza ra mzuri.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.26.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.26.32"
            ]
          }
        }
